<urn:atm:triage:finding/CPR-013>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-013" ;
  triage:title "BA.2 rejection and migration tests assert weaker properties than their doc lines, and one documented case is untested" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. BA.2 rejection and migration tests assert weaker properties than their doc lines, and one documented case is untested. Doc says: sprint-BA.2 names writer_close_by_third_party_is_rejected, writer_stale_counterparty_is_rejected, a MoveTarget::Head-with-active-task case, and replay_of_migrated_history_reproduces_row_state over five fixtures. Code does: writer_close_by_third_party_is_rejected asserts only `.last().assignee == 'alice'` and cannot fail. writer_stale_counterparty_is_rejected does not construct the reassign race it names. MoveTarget::Head with an active task at position 2 is untested anywhere in the workspace. replay_of_migrated_history_reproduces_row_state is near-tautological and covers 3 of the 5 documented fixtures. Recommendation: Fix the four bodies, add the Head-behind-active case, and either rename the shipped tests to the documented names or amend the doc. solar review-3 item B3, with negation proof per test." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/tests/task_identity.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2A8MZRBR51PDNSSS1HAV6NK, 2026-09-12T07:34:59Z): fixed by solar at review-3 14e9e6bc7, gate-green. Sha remap (fenix ATM 01M2A9NY2AEAKS6EAHY0V4ZDYB, 2026-09-12T07:52:59Z): review-3 rebased onto review-2 33754d69d (force-with-lease); 14e9e6bc7 -> 4c7b8ceec." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BA6 ;
